<description>&lt;p&gt;China's coast guard continues to monitor Philippine resupply missions to the grounded vessel at Ren\'ai Jiao and has shadowed a U.S. warship near a disputed shoal, while Chinese warships and a research vessel were also sighted near the Bajo de Masinloc. The Philippines is deepening cooperation with Taiwan to protect undersea cables, and Taiwan is open to joint cable-protection efforts. An ex-NSA has urged activation of the Philippines-China coast guard agreement, and the Philippines’ coast guard rescued four people on Hagonoy Island. 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPTU9McVh3djNpcDhfdlJmTzN0ZVIyX2F0dDRvZ1VRZzZKVVpxRG1pYTFJWjA3OEhzMmg3Umd1WnozUC1rSnRqWG9XaTZnQl9UbHl4UTZSRVpvY2YzUmlkX2FIR3NQbDU0aGljMC0wcTlfYU1jRlp2X3Z1RmdMb1NVNUxVUzhzUXFBRUhKMmFGSWtlTGlQdEFJOUpYTDRzbG5ua3FVR0hISFdQVElneEs3d2JTSVk0ay1xTi11dkJn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOZ1Q3eWpWSWNwQ3Z4ejNoSnAyYno1czdWaTVtUWRTc0tRdDQ2eVk5SGQ5X1QxV0h0Zkw2VzM2Ul9sdVhCX2o1dERiRWRIcTRsZ3JBdjU5ZWJGTXd4S3JvM3pxNklNMGw4SXppYXVaY1RjMmgzWjVZTGVIOGN1UlRHMXpncFFBaVllLVVhN0k5S2F0V0ZKZnFQaWJCYkNZY0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;dominotheory.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTFBYdTJXOW1PMTVMN2xwb1M1Sk1MampwMHRac0tqVkltY2lnUlVNU2w0VkY5dmRrbEVvTEVvSGphMWRtQ0ZITXM2d0RvNnp6M3NoLVVvbFFEaWNsVEZXRktCS0xCZU5YLXhNLUtoanVLMlZSZktDNHBQcDFRLXE0QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Asia News Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQNUc5clJ6c3JINHdJaDRRYXlVdExkdnBxNmFheUZqOEtGWVNETWRQb2dLUlVQLTFFd0wtS0dyZkR1aTRjU3gtZl83VEJrTHh0OGRvVXE5c2U2Sk9KMEFwSGxrTW85UG0xT1Y2WWd0WGwyMkNYSC1DWUtsbVVsVjJYaGhBMDI1cWJHaDhmUk54VG1OY3NmUTc5WXpFbGpOZEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;brigadanews.ph&lt;/